TechOS Releases

Official release history and version planning.

Versioning

TechOS uses a major.minor.patch versioning scheme.

Format: "MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH"

Development Channels

- Unstable: Experimental development builds.
- Testing: Builds undergoing validation.
- Stable: Releases considered ready for general use.

